WEBVTT

00:05:29.742 --> 00:05:33.454
animals have been defined
in opposition to humans.

00:05:34.038 --> 00:05:36.332
Dogs lived out in the fields

00:05:36.332 --> 00:05:39.126
or live out in the fields or the yard.

00:05:39.168 --> 00:05:40.795
They might come in the house.

00:05:41.128 --> 00:05:43.297
They didn't come into the bedroom,

00:05:43.339 --> 00:05:45.883
and they certainly
didn't come into the bed.

00:05:45.883 --> 00:05:47.426
(Laughter)

00:05:47.802 --> 00:05:50.388
Charlie's not supposed to be
in my bed, but, hey.

00:05:51.514 --> 00:05:54.266
And the thing to think about
that was interesting is this.

00:05:55.309 --> 00:05:57.436
What is different
in these different contexts

00:05:57.436 --> 00:05:59.188
isn't necessarily the dog.

00:05:59.772 --> 00:06:02.316
It's our idea of family.